# Project Conventions

## Component Structure
- Components follow the pattern `<ComponentName>/index.tsx`, NOT `<ComponentName>.tsx`
- When searching for components, always check for the `/index.tsx` pattern first
- Example: `components/Viewer/index.tsx`, `components/MainCanvas/index.tsx`

## Code Style
- TypeScript throughout
- Material-UI (MUI) for UI components with `sx` prop styling
- React hooks for state management

## File Organization
- Components in `src/components/`
- Hooks in `src/hooks/`
- Types in `src/types/`
- Styles in `src/styles/`
